<%# The scheduler's view of this same ledger: what a minute of each harness +
    model combination costs.

    It belongs on this page because it is a costing figure derived from these
    very rows at these very prices — but it is the number the spot gate acts on,
    so the card says so and links to where that happens.

    Deliberately NOT scoped to the window picker above. These are the current
    rates as BurnRateRecomputeJob last computed them, over a fixed sample of
    recent sessions per combination; re-deriving them for "last 90 days" would
    answer a different question under the same heading. %>
<div class="bg-white shadow rounded-lg overflow-hidden mb-6" id="burn-rates">
  <div class="px-4 py-3 border-b border-gray-200">
    <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">Burn rate by harness + model</h2>
    <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-gray-500">
      Dollars per minute of elapsed session time, measured over the last
      <%= HarnessModelBurnRate::SAMPLE_SESSIONS %> sessions of each combination. The
      <%= link_to "spot gate", inference_path(anchor: "spot-gate"), class: "text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-500" %>
      multiplies these by how long until it next looks to decide whether one more session fits
      inside the quota window's remaining non-reserved capacity. Current rates, not rates for the
      window selected above.
    </p>
  </div>
  <% if rates.blank? %>
    <p class="px-4 py-6 text-sm text-gray-500">
      No rates computed yet — BurnRateRecomputeJob needs sessions in the ledger before it can
      measure one.
    </p>
  <% else %>
    <div class="overflow-x-auto">
      <table class="min-w-full divide-y divide-gray-200 text-sm">
        <thead class="bg-gray-50">
          <tr>
            <th scope="col" class="px-4 py-2 text-left font-medium text-gray-500">Harness</th>
            <th scope="col" class="px-4 py-2 text-left font-medium text-gray-500">Model</th>
            <th scope="col" class="px-4 py-2 text-right font-medium text-gray-500">$/min</th>
            <th scope="col" class="px-4 py-2 text-right font-medium text-gray-500">$/hr</th>
            <th scope="col" class="px-4 py-2 text-right font-medium text-gray-500">Sessions</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-100 bg-white">
          <% rates.each do |rate| %>
            <tr>
              <td class="px-4 py-2 text-gray-900 font-medium break-all"><%= rate.harness %></td>
              <td class="px-4 py-2 text-gray-500 font-mono text-xs break-all"><%= rate.model %></td>
              <td class="px-4 py-2 text-right text-gray-900 tabular-nums"><%= number_to_currency(rate.usd_per_minute, precision: 3) %></td>
              <td class="px-4 py-2 text-right text-gray-500 tabular-nums"><%= number_to_currency(rate.usd_per_hour, precision: 2) %></td>
              <td class="px-4 py-2 text-right text-gray-500 tabular-nums"><%= rate.sample_session_count %></td>
            </tr>
          <% end %>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  <% end %>
</div>
